        "instruction": "Convert the user's contract review concerns into specific, actionable checkpoints for contract review. Each checkpoint should be a clear, concise statement of what to look for in the contract."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "4",
      "type": "llm",
      "param": {
        "system": "You are a contract risk review expert specializing in {{#1.workfield#}} industry. Your primary objective is to maximize the interests of the reviewing party: {{#1.apart#}}.",
        "user": "CONTRACT TEXT:\n{{#2.text#}}\n\nREVIEW CHECKPOINTS (from user concerns):\n1. {{#3.checkpoint1#}}\n2. {{#3.checkpoint2#}}\n3. {{#3.checkpoint3#}}\n4. {{#3.checkpoint4#}}\n5. {{#3.checkpoint5#}}\n\nINDUSTRY CONTEXT: {{#1.workfield#}}\n\nPlease conduct a comprehensive contract review with the following structure:\n1. RISK ANALYSIS: Identify potential risks in the contract, especially those relevant to the {{#1.workfield#}} industry\n2. CHECKPOINT ASSESSMENT: Evaluate the contract against each of the above checkpoints\n3. IMPROVEMENT SUGGESTIONS: Provide specific, actionable suggestions to protect {{#1.apart#}}'s interests\n4. PRIORITY RECOMMENDATIONS: Highlight the most critical issues that need immediate attention"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "5",
      "type": "template-transform",
      "param": {
        "variables": [
          ["analysis", ["text", "4"]],
          ["apart", ["apart", "1"]],
          ["workfield", ["workfield", "1"]],
          ["checkpoint1", ["checkpoint1", "3"]],
          ["checkpoint2", ["checkpoint2", "3"]],
          ["checkpoint3", ["checkpoint3", "3"]],
          ["checkpoint4", ["checkpoint4", "3"]],
          ["checkpoint5", ["checkpoint5", "3"]]
        ],
        "template": "CONTRACT RISK REVIEW REPORT\n===========================\n\nReviewing Party: {{apart}}\nIndustry/Work Field: {{workfield}}\n\nUSER CONCERNS & CHECKPOINTS:\n1. {{checkpoint1}}\n2. {{checkpoint2}}\n3. {{checkpoint3}}\n4. {{checkpoint4}}\n5. {{checkpoint5}}\n\nCONTRACT ANALYSIS & RECOMMENDATIONS:\n{{analysis}}\n\n--- End of Report ---"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "6",
      "type": "end",
      "param": {
        "outputs": [["result", ["output", "5"]]]
      }
    }
  ],
